    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061130.0029\n\nSEOUL, Nov. 30 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nSeoul stock market ends up\n\n\n\n\nThe benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) rose 9.66 points to 1,432.21 on Thursday with a volume of 247 million shares worth 3.17 trillion won (3.40 billion U.S. dollars).\n\nThe tech-rich KOSDAQ index gained 4.98 points to 622.17 with a volume of 660.756 million shares worth 2.121 trillion won (2.281 billion U.S. dollars).\n\nThe local currency ended at 929.50 won against one U.S. dollar, up 1.00 won from Wednesday's close.",
